				"description": "The activity of the application this server is hosted for, read when called: `activity` holds up to twenty of the newest commits of its source history, with the units and reasons of each, its loop usage and up to forty files those commits changed, and `live` holds up to twelve of its checkouts, each with its branch, head and up to forty uncommitted paths, and the agents registered in any of its checkouts. It is undefined when any part of the read throws, so undefined means the activity is unavailable, not an empty result.",
